        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is Ka'Chava a protein powder?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Not exactly. Ka'Chava is a meal shake that contains protein. Each two-scoop serving gives about 25 g of plant protein in roughly 240 calories, per the label at the time of writing, alongside fiber, fats, carbohydrates and a vitamin and mineral premix. A dedicated protein powder delivers similar protein in about half the calories and at a much lower cost per gram."
